#82093=PRODUCT('CD74HC4067','','The CD74HC4067 and CD74HCT4067 devices are digitally\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\controlled analog switches that utilize silicon-gate CMOS\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\technology to achieve operating speeds similar to LSTTL,\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\with the low power consumption of standard CMOS\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\integrated circuits.\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\These analog multiplexers/demultiplexers control analog\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\voltages that may vary across the voltage supply range.\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\They are bidirectional switches thus allowing any analog\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\input to be used as an output and vice-versa. The switches\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\have low \X2\201C\X0\on\X2\201D\X0\ resistance and low \X2\201C\X0\off\X2\201D\X0\ leakages. In addition,\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\these devices have an enable control which when high will\X2\000D\X0\\X2\000A\X0\disable all switches to their \X2\201C\X0\off\X2\201D\X0\ state.\X2\000D\X0\',(#2)) ;
